        {
         "role": "type.title",
         "text": "Executive summary: decline the $11.40 offer"
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "region",
       "id": "body",
       "weight": 1.0,
       "layout": {
        "kind": "flex",
        "direction": "row",
        "gap_role": "space.gutter",
        "pad_role": null,
        "align": "start",
        "justify": "start"
       },
       "children": [
        {
         "type": "element",
         "id": "left",
         "kind": "text",
         "weight": 1.0,
         "paragraphs": [
          {
           "role": "type.h2",
           "text": "Valuation"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "The $11.40 offer implies 1.33x P / TBV against a 1.08x regional median; every method on the football field tops out below $12.50 except the most generous precedent set"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Standalone DDM midpoint of $10.40 at a 9.25% cost of equity; the offer needs 40% cost synergies to be accretive by FY17"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.h2",
           "text": "Strategic fit"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "First Niagara is a pure-play commercial lender: 80% of revenue is net interest income versus 55% for KeyBank, which has spent a decade diversifying"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Geographic overlap is limited to western New York and Pennsylvania; no funding-cost or IP benefit"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.h2",
           "text": "Returns and capital"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "ROTCE of 9.0% and CET1 of 9.4% both trail KeyBank; the combined entity dilutes tangible book value per share by 11% at close with a 4.5-year earn-back"
          }
         ]
        },
        {
         "type": "region",
         "id": "rightcol",
         "weight": 0.9,
         "layout": {
          "kind": "flex",
          "direction": "column",
          "gap_role": "space.sm",
          "pad_role": null,
          "align": "stretch",
          "justify": "start"
         },
         "children": [
          {
           "type": "element",
           "id": "kpis",
           "kind": "table",
           "table": {
            "columns": [
             {
              "key": "m",
              "label": "Metric",
              "value_kind": "text"
             },
             {
              "key": "fnfg",
              "label": "First Niagara",
              "value_kind": "number"
             },
             {
