           "role": "type.h2",
           "text": "How to read it"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Only City National and National Penn priced higher on tangible book, and both targets earned returns above 12%"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "At 40% synergies the deal matches the most aggressive case in the set (FirstMerit), which is still being integrated"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Premium of 26% is in line with the median; the issue is the starting multiple, not the premium"
          }
