           "text": "Branch overlap is 14% of First Niagara's network; consolidation above 60 branches cuts deposits"
          },
          {
           "role": "type.body",
           "bullet_level": 0,
           "text": "Systems conversion in year one has delayed accretion by two to four quarters in three of the five precedents"
